Oh, forget it. I can't do everybody.

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:36.100
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:40.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:14:40.767 --> 00:14:42.367
-Well, you forgot to mention

00:14:42.367 --> 00:14:45.067
