00:14:45.067 --> 00:14:47.267
-Well, we got a lot of jokes to tell.

00:14:47.267 --> 00:14:49.100
Guys --

00:14:49.100 --> 00:14:50.501
[ Audience awws ]

00:14:50.501 --> 00:14:53.501
