00:15:14.767 --> 00:15:17.534
We let it rip in this place."

00:15:17.534 --> 00:15:19.834
Thank you for watching, TJ Maxx.

00:15:19.834 --> 00:15:22.734
We love you guys.

00:15:22.734 --> 00:15:24.834
-You're a Maxxanista. -Yeah.

00:15:24.834 --> 00:15:26.167
Get this, everyone.

00:15:26.167 --> 00:15:28.234
Snoop Dogg's professional blunt roller

00:15:28.234 --> 00:15:32.734
just revealed that Snoop smokes up to 150 blunts a day.

00:15:32.734 --> 00:15:34.367
You know, I'm worried

00:15:34.367 --> 00:15:36.434
because if this keeps up, he might form a habit.

00:15:36.434 --> 00:15:38.300
[ Laughter ]

00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:40.033
Guys, I heard about a documentary

00:15:40.033 --> 00:15:42.033
