00:18:44.734 --> 00:18:46.567
You'll find lots of the major brands,

00:18:46.567 --> 00:18:48.801
like New Balance and Nike Air Jordans.

00:18:48.801 --> 00:18:53.400
You can even get your horse sneakers to match your own.

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:56.667
-They have horse sneakers from Nike, New Balance,

00:18:56.667 --> 00:18:58.534
and even those gross toe shoes

00:18:58.534 --> 00:19:01.601
that everyone's embarrassed to wear in public.

00:19:01.601 --> 00:19:05.601
They don't wear them in public. Only at home.

00:19:05.601 --> 00:19:07.901
And finally, Costco is selling

00:19:07.901 --> 00:19:10.067
the world's largest jigsaw puzzle.

00:19:10.067 --> 00:19:15.200
It's 29 feet long, 8 feet tall, and 60,000 pieces.

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:17.767
Yeah, the bottom left corner goes on your coffee table.

00:19:17.767 --> 00:19:19.968
The bottom right goes in Zimbabwe.

00:19:19.968 --> 00:19:22.400
And a helpful hint. Here's what I did.

00:19:22.400 --> 00:19:26.701
Start by taking seven or eight days to find the corner pieces.

00:19:26.701 --> 00:19:28.868
Kanye West is in the news.

00:19:28.868 --> 00:19:31.067
[ Laughter ]

