00:28:36.000 --> 00:28:38.901
I'll show you what I mean. Alexa, what's the weather?

00:28:38.901 --> 00:28:41.400
-Alexa: Give me 20 bucks, and I'll tell you.

00:28:41.400 --> 00:28:44.767
[ Laughter ]

00:28:44.767 --> 00:28:46.567
[ Applause ]

00:28:51.801 --> 00:28:53.767
-Alexa, I'm not gonna give you 20 bucks.

00:28:53.767 --> 00:28:57.601
