00:29:04.701 --> 00:29:06.734
[ Laughter ]

00:29:06.734 --> 00:29:08.634
-Alexa...

00:29:08.634 --> 00:29:11.734
-Guys, did you see that Senate Majority Leader Chuck Schumer

00:29:11.734 --> 00:29:14.334
