00:29:20.033 --> 00:29:21.567
Yeah, I'm actually not surprised

00:29:21.567 --> 00:29:23.234
Herschel Walker is climbing in the polls.

00:29:23.234 --> 00:29:25.367
He's somehow the most anti- and pro-abortion candidate

00:29:25.367 --> 00:29:26.934
