00:29:26.934 --> 00:29:28.934
[ Laughter ]

00:29:30.100 --> 00:29:31.834
-Come on! -Amazing.

00:29:31.834 --> 00:29:33.501
-That's a good joke! -Never seen anything like it.

00:29:33.501 --> 00:29:35.033
-Wow. -It's tough for Schumer.

00:29:35.033 --> 00:29:36.734
You got to try and talk soft enough

00:29:36.734 --> 00:29:38.100
