00:29:38.100 --> 00:29:40.467
but loud enough so Biden can hear.

00:29:40.467 --> 00:29:41.601
I don't blame him.

00:29:41.601 --> 00:29:43.534
Why don't we check in with Steve Mandel

00:29:43.534 --> 00:29:45.400
