00:30:11.734 --> 00:30:14.000
For example, reliable ends videos with...

00:30:20.601 --> 00:30:22.968
Brah!

00:30:22.968 --> 00:30:25.467
Smash it, brah!

00:30:25.467 --> 00:30:27.267
You see, here's another example.

00:30:32.200 --> 00:30:33.834
Next up...

00:30:42.601 --> 00:30:44.834
"Talk to Kurt. Talk to Kurt."

00:30:44.834 --> 00:30:46.334
Reliable...

00:30:51.167 --> 00:30:53.000
-Ooh.

00:30:53.000 --> 00:30:54.901
-Here's a final example.

00:30:59.400 --> 00:31:02.234
I hope those help. I hope that helps you out.

00:31:02.234 --> 00:31:03.901
Some sports news -- tonight was game one

